{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.poster.avif?t=1772110076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.webm?t=1772110076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.mp4?t=1772110076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Design Your Dream Cat Caf\u00e9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into your furry boss role! Customize every detail \u2013 arrange furniture, decorate walls, and design paw-some zones. Unlock tons of cat-themed items, mix-and-match styles, and create your ultimate cozy hangout. Deck out comfy nooks with plush pillows, fresh flowers, and cute decor where cats can chill and nap in style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Cook Up Purr-fect Cat Treats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master two key areas:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2615 Coffee Bar: Grind beans, whip up chocolatey lattes, and craft signature drinks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf6a Bakery: Knead dough, swirl fruit jams, and bake cat-safe goodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up to unlock new recipes and keep customers coming back for more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Hire Your Purr-sonal Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit expert kitties:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Purristas: Craft paw-some beverages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Meowffin Makers: Bake drool-worthy snacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Cashier Cats: Speed through orders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Clean-up Crew: Keep the joint spotless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train your squad, kit them out with cute gear, and run a purr-fessional operation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Grow Your Kitty Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start small in your tiny shop and level up your biz! Earn coins and XP to expand your space. Unlock the Bakery Mode later \u2013 get ovens and decorating stations to create cat cakes and pawprint cookies. Personalize your caf\u00e9 with wall art, rugs, and themed decorations to attract rare cats who\u2019ll become your caf\u00e9\u2019s main attraction!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675770?t=1772110076","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/a974b7a4d789b06ae11d386ea63a0c3b53c961e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772110076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/7a5bcd796fb6da2e9abc712ef6f6666d02ade542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772110076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/7a5bcd796fb6da2e9abc712ef6f6666d02ade542/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772110076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.poster.avif?t=1772110076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.webm?t=1772110076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/extras/66f8af17c216ddcfd624c299ceac5250.mp4?t=1772110076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Design Your Dream Cat Caf\u00e9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into your furry boss role! Customize every detail \u2013 arrange furniture, decorate walls, and design paw-some zones. Unlock tons of cat-themed items, mix-and-match styles, and create your ultimate cozy hangout. Deck out comfy nooks with plush pillows, fresh flowers, and cute decor where cats can chill and nap in style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Cook Up Purr-fect Cat Treats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master two key areas:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2615 Coffee Bar: Grind beans, whip up chocolatey lattes, and craft signature drinks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf6a Bakery: Knead dough, swirl fruit jams, and bake cat-safe goodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up to unlock new recipes and keep customers coming back for more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Hire Your Purr-sonal Dream Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit expert kitties:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Purristas: Craft paw-some beverages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Meowffin Makers: Bake drool-worthy snacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Cashier Cats: Speed through orders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Clean-up Crew: Keep the joint spotless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train your squad, kit them out with cute gear, and run a purr-fessional operation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Grow Your Kitty Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start small in your tiny shop and level up your biz! Earn coins and XP to expand your space. Unlock the Bakery Mode later \u2013 get ovens and decorating stations to create cat cakes and pawprint cookies. Personalize your caf\u00e9 with wall art, rugs, and themed decorations to attract rare cats who\u2019ll become your caf\u00e9\u2019s main attraction!</strong></p>","developers":["XINGXIAN NET"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675770/bb308b532ca8dc13087ee73b147745115a880034/header.jpg?t=1772110076","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675770/1126149885/dd22a5064e38676dec3d8051d1f49932ad18634a/1750761986/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750763305","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675770/1126149885/dd22a5064e38676dec3d8051d1f49932ad18634a/1750761986/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750763305","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675770/1126149885/dd22a5064e38676dec3d8051d1f49932ad18634a/1750761986/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750763305","id":257160646,"name":"Bean Meets Paw","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps